<#@ template language="C#" inherits="IntentTemplateBase<Intent.Modelers.Services.CQRS.Api.CommandModel>" #>
<#@ assembly name="System.Core" #>
<#@ import namespace="System.Collections.Generic" #>
<#@ import namespace="System.Linq" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common.Templates" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Metadata.Models" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modelers.Services.CQRS.Api" #>
<#@ import namespace="Aryzac.GitHubIssues.Api" #>
---
id: <#= Model.Id #>
title: "task(command): Add <#= Model.Name #> command handler"
type: task
<# if (Model.HasGitHubIssueClosed()) { #>
closed: true
<# } else { #>
closed: false
<# } #>
---
<# if (Model.HasBusinessRequirement()) { #>

### Business Goal

<#= Model.GetBusinessRequirement().Summary() #>
<# if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.Comment)) { #>

<#= Model.Comment #>
<# } } #>

### Scope & Notes

| Property | Type | Nullable | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
<# foreach (var property in Model.Properties) { #>
| <#= property.Name #> | <#= property.TypeReference.Element.Name #> <#= property.TypeReference.IsCollection ? "[]" : "" #> | <#= property.TypeReference.IsNullable ? "Yes" : "No" #> | <#= string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(property.Comment) ? "" : property.Comment #> |
<# } #>

Estimated Effort
Estimated Days: 1

| Task                                         | Target Hours   |
|----------------------------------------------|----------------|
| Define command                               | 0.5h           |
| Add validator (or justify N/A)               | 0.5h           |
| Implement handler (repository + domain call) | 1.0h           |
| (Opt) Response mapping                       | 0.5h           |
| Tests (happy, not found, validation, events) | 2.0h           |
| Documentation updates                        | 0.5h           |
| Buffer                                       | 0.5h           |
| Total Target Hours                           | 5.0h (≈ 1 day) |

Acceptance Checklist
- [ ] Command implements IRequest<<#= Model.Name #>>/IRequest and ICommand
- [ ] Validator created or explicitly marked N/A
- [ ] Handler loads aggregate via repository and invokes domain method
- [ ] Domain method raises necessary events
- [ ] Mapping/response handled after mutation (or N/A documented)
- [ ] Tests cover happy path, not found, validation failure, domain event emission
- [ ] Documentation updated (this recipe referenced)
- [ ] Effort variance >20% noted in issue comments